menu "WiFi Configuration"

    config WIFI_SSID
        string "WiFi SSID"
        default "myssid"
        help
            SSID of the WiFi network to join.

    config WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi password"
        default "mypassword"
        help
            WiFi password. Networks weaker than WPA2 are rejected unless this
            is left empty, in which case an open network is expected.

    config WIFI_MAX_BACKOFF_MS
        int "Max WiFi reconnect backoff (ms)"
        default 30000
        range 1000 600000
        help
            Upper bound on the delay between reconnect attempts. The delay
            starts at 1s and doubles after each failed attempt up to this
            value. Reconnection is retried indefinitely.

endmenu
